        "The restaurant changes its menu, replacing two of the items with different\n",
        "foods. Add a line that rewrites the tuple, and then use a for loop to print\n",
        "each of the items on the revised menu."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "cbKutxydizrU"
      }
    },
